.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH PDFLUENT-MODELS 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent\-models \- Install and inspect the opt\-in model tiers\*(Aq files
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent models\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Install and inspect the opt\-in model tiers\*(Aq files
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
pdfluent\-models\-install(1)
Download and verify model packages into the per\-user model dir. The only command that ever downloads a model or runtime library
.TP
pdfluent\-models\-status(1)
Show what is installed in the per\-user model dir, and whether the pins verify
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
